# Your watching, not the app.
#
# data/ holds state.json — every collection path, every position, your whole
# watch history, the phone remote's pairing code and its issued tokens, and your
# TMDB key if you set one. None of that belongs in a public repository.
data/

# Downloaded artwork and subtitles are other people's copyrighted material,
# cached locally for your own use. They are re-fetchable, so they are not worth
# carrying and not ours to redistribute.
data/art/
data/subs/

# Bundled Node and VLC binaries, plus the archives they came from. Hundreds of
# megabytes, and everyone should fetch them from the official upstreams anyway.
runtime/

# Editor and tooling scratch
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Logs and stray archives
*.log
*.zip
*.tar.xz
*.bak
